$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM General/Typical Procedure:
4-Amino-5-phenyl-7-(β-D-ribofuranosyl)-7H-pyrrolo[2,3-d]pyrimidine (6a).
An argon purged mixture of 7-iodotubercidin 7 (200 mg, 0.51 mmol),
phenylboronic acid (93 mg, 0.76 mmol), Na2CO3 (502 mg, 4.74 mmol),
Pd(OAc)2 (6.6 mg, 0.029 mmol), and TPPTS (42 mg, 0.07 mmol) in water/MeCN
(2:1, 3.6 mL) was stirred at 100 °C for 1 h. After cooling, the mixture
was neutralized by the addition of aqueous HCl (1M), volatiles were
removed in vacuo and the residue was purified by reverse phase
chromatography (0→100% MeOH in water).
4-Amino-5-(1H-pyrrol-2-yl)-7-(β-D-ribofuranosyl)-7H-pyrrolo[2,3-d]pyrimidine
(6k). Compound 6k was prepared as described for 6a from compound 7 and
1-N-(Boc)-pyrrole-2-boronic acid; reaction time 3 h; yield 77%; white
solid after recrystallization from MeOH and after decolorization with
active carbon. mp 205-207 °C; [α]D -80.5 (c 0.205, DMSO). UV (MeOH): λmax
(ε) 283 (8800), 260 (11500). 1H NMR (500.0 MHz, DMSO-d6): 3.54 (ddd, 1H,
Jgem = 11.9, J5'b,OH = 6.2, J5'b,4' = 3.9, H-5'b); 3.62 (dd, 1H, Jgem =
11.9, J5'a,OH = 5.0, J5'a,4' = 3.9, H-5'a); 3.90 (td, 1H, J4',5' = 3.9,
J4',3' = 3.1, H-4'); 4.09 (ddd, 1H, J3',2' = 5.1, J3',OH = 4.8, J3',4' =
3.1, H-3'); 4.41 (ddd, 1H, J2',OH = 6.5, J2',1' = 6.3, J2',3' = 5.1,
H-2'); 5.17 (d, 1H, JOH,3' = 4.8, OH-3'); 5.20 (dd, 1H, JOH,5' = 6.2,
5.0, OH-5'); 5.33 (d, 1H, JOH,2' = 6.5, OH-5'); 6.09 (d, 1H, J1',2' =
6.3, H-1'); 6.13 (ddd, 1H, J3,4 = 3.3, J3,NH = 2.4, J3,5 = 1.5,
H-3-pyrr); 6.16 (ddd, 1H, J4,3 = 3.3, J4,5 = 2.7, J4,NH = 2.4, H-4-pyrr);
6.32 (bs, 2H, NH2); 6.85 (td, 1H, J5,4 = J5,NH = 2.7, J5,3 = 1.5,
H-5-pyrr); 7.43 (s, 1H, H-6); 8.12 (s, 1H, H-2); 11.14 (bs, 1H, NH-pyrr).
13C NMR (125.7 MHz, DMSO-d6): 62.00 (CH2-5'); 70.92 (CH-3'); 74.11
(CH-2'); 85.30 (CH-4'); 87.20 (CH-1'); 101.09 (C-4a); 107.34 (CH-3-pyrr);
108.68 (C-5); 109.06 (CH-4-pyrr); 118.77 (CH-5-pyrr); 120.55 (CH-6);
124.69 (C-2-pyrr); 150.35 (C-7a); 151.98 (CH-2); 157.62 (C-4). MS (ESI)
m/z 332 (M+H), 354 (M+Na). HRMS (ESI) for C15H18N5O4 [M+H] calcd:
332.1353; found: 332.1354. Anal. Calcd for (C15H17N5O4·1/3H2O): C, 53.41;
H, 5.28; N, 20.76. Found: C, 53.32; H, 5.16; N, 20.57.
