$DATUM (E)-N'-(3-Cyano-6-(methylthio)-5-(thiophen-3-yl)pyridin-2-yl)-N,N-dimethylformimidamide
(21h, R4 = H, R5 = 3- Thiophenyl, R6 = SMe). The product was isolated as
a yellow solid (54.1 mg, 76%). Pd-catalyzed cross coupling of 20a or 20b
with various boronic acids or boronate esters under typical Suzuki
conditions proceeded in good yield (avee yields of 45−70%). 1H NMR (400
MHz, CDCl3): δ 8.72 (s, 1H), 7.54 (s, 1H), 7.40 (ddd, J = 7.9, 3.9, 2.2
Hz, 2H), 7.22 (dd, J = 4.9, 1.4 Hz, 1H), 3.21 (s, 3H), 3.17 (s, 3H), 2.51
(s, 3H). 13C NMR (126 MHz, DMSO-d6): δ 161.6, 161.0, 155.7, 140.5, 136.8,
128.3, 125.7, 124.3, 124.2, 118.1, 96.5, 41.1, 35.0, 13.7. MS [ESI+] m/z:
303.16 [M + H+]+.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
$DATUM Suzuki cross coupling reaction, literature preparation
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
